BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:All Soul's Procession
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261106
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261109
DTSTAMP:20261017T131758Z
UID:193ca5ef52cf719777c87571@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:A two-mile\, human-powered procession that ends in the finaliz
 ing action of burning a large urn filled with the hopes\, offerings and wi
 shes for those who have passed. The event also includes installation art\,
  altars\, performers and creative artists. The All Souls Procession\, and 
 now the entire All Souls Weekend\, is a celebration and mourning of the li
 ves of our loved ones who have passed.\n\nEvent website: https://allsoulsp
 rocession.org/\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visitarizona.com/even
 ts/all-soul-s-procession
LAST-MODIFIED:20261017T131758Z
URL:https://www.visitarizona.com/events/all-soul-s-procession
END:VEVENT
